      <appendix xml:id="appendix-image-attributions">
        <title>Image Attributions</title>
        <p>The following images are used in this module. Where known, source, author, and license information is provided.</p>

        <!-- One entry per image, in the order the images appear in the book.  -->
        <!-- Each entry opens with an  xref  whose text is a description of    -->
        <!-- the image (text="custom"), pointing at the closest numbered       -->
        <!-- division that holds it. On the web that description is the link,  -->
        <!-- and hovering it shows where the link goes. In print PreTeXt puts  -->
        <!-- the page number right after the description, so an entry reads    -->
        <!-- "Axel, p. 12: ...".                                               -->
        <!-- This book shares its worksheets with the Teaching Guide, so the   -->
        <!-- same images are credited there too. Only the images that appear   -->
        <!-- in this book are listed here.                                     -->
        <p>
        <ul>
          <li><p><xref ref="cuatroAmigos-ws-cuatroAmigos" text="custom">Axel</xref>: <url href="https://boudewijnhuijgens.getarchive.net/amp/media/los-angeles-kids-boy-people-67771c" visual="boudewijnhuijgens.getarchive.net">GetArchive</url>, from a pre-July-2017 Pixabay upload (CC0). Public domain.</p></li>
          <li><p><xref ref="cuatroAmigos-ws-cuatroAmigos" text="custom">Ben</xref>: <url href="https://www.pexels.com/photo/portrait-of-an-asian-boy-in-black-and-white-18124971/" visual="www.pexels.com">Pexels</url> photo by Aibek Skakov, <url href="https://www.pexels.com/license/" visual="pexels.com">Pexels License</url>.</p></li>
          <li><p><xref ref="cuatroAmigos-ws-cuatroAmigos" text="custom">Cora</xref>: <url href="https://www.rawpixel.com/search/women%20latin?page=1&amp;path=_topics%7C%24editorial%7C%248%5Cx2e5%3A11&amp;sort=curated" visual="www.rawpixel.com">Young Latin-American girl, FSA camp, Robstown, Texas</url>, a Library of Congress U.S. Government work. Public domain.</p></li>
          <li><p><xref ref="cuatroAmigos-ws-cuatroAmigos" text="custom">Dana</xref>: <url href="https://freerangestock.com/photos/159193/black-and-white-portrait-of-a-girl.html" visual="freerangestock.com">FreeRange Stock</url> photo by Candace McDaniel, from the site's CC0 Images. Public domain.</p></li>
        </ul>
        </p>

